---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import insIcon from '../assets/img/ins.png';
import vimeoIcon from '../assets/img/vimeo.png';
---

<style is:global>
  .spacetop2 {padding: 20px 0 60px;}
  .infotext {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: auto;
  }

</style>

<div class="flex flex-wrap text-center pt-8 infotext">
  <div class="w-full">
    <h2>NIMA NABILI RAD</h2>
    <p>
      <br>
      / CREATIVE DIRECTOR
      <br>
      / DIRECTOR
      <br>
      / PHOTOGRAPHER
      <br><br>
      Nima was born in iran and moved to australia at 16.
      <br>
      There he completed an honours degree in creative arts.
      <br>
      His multi award-winning portfolio so far includes international branded content, short special projects, tvc's and music videos.
      <br>
      His work has been featured on vice, vimeo staff picks, hypebeast, complex, rolling stone, paper magazine, I-d, booooooom and fubiz.
      <br>
      And selected and screened at berlin commercial, mtv, coachella, and fashion film festival milano among others.
      <br>
      His lush photographic work is an immersive invitation.
      <br>
      He can never remember his dreams when he wakes up.
      <br>
      So he creates art to make up for it.<br><br>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
    <p>DIRECT CONTACT
      <br>
      <a href="mailto:hello@nimanabilirad.com">hello@nimanabilirad.com</a>
      <br>
      <a href="tel:+61414197556">+61 414 197 556</a>
      <br>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
    <p>
      SPAIN / SAUVAGE
      <br>
      <a href="http://sauvage.tv/" target="_blank">sauvage.tv</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
    <p>
      AUSTRALIA / YBY CREATIVE
      <br>
      <a href="http://ybycreative.tv/" target="_blank">ybycreative.tv</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="w-full spacetop2">
    <a class="icon" href="https://www.instagram.com/nnrlovesyou/" target="_blank">
      <Image src={insIcon} alt="Instagram @nnrlovesyou" />
    </a>
    <a class="icon" href="https://vimeo.com/nimanabilirad" target="_blank">
      <Image src={vimeoIcon} alt="Vimeo" />
    </a>
    <a class="icon" href="https://www.instagram.com/nimanabilirad" target="_blank">
      <Image src={insIcon} alt="Instagram @nimanabilirad" />
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="w-full spacetop2">
    Website by <a href="https://banta.co/" target="_blank">BANTA</a>
  </div>
</div>
